# All variables are OPTIONAL. RepoPilot runs fully hosted with zero server secrets.
# Public Production and Preview Vercel projects MUST leave JULES_API_KEY,
# GEMINI_API_KEY, and GITHUB_PAT unset. Setting a shared key on the Vercel
# project is a security blocker for v1 (every visitor would share one provider account).
#
# Each user enters keys in the in-app Settings modal (stored only in their browser,
# sent per-request via x-jules-api-key, x-gemini-api-key, x-github-pat headers).
# The app remains fully functional when all three environment variables are empty.
# Local .env.local may still set them for solo operator convenience.

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Optional server default for Gemini audit evaluation.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# JULES_API_KEY: Optional server default for Google Jules agent dispatch.
JULES_API_KEY=""

# GITHUB_PAT: Optional GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) with repo scope,
# for private repository diffs and higher API rate limits.
GITHUB_PAT=""
